<title>UK: Salomon Inc sets $150 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Salomon Inc sets $150 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate</p>
<p>issue was self-led by Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SALOMON INC</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *16.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +40 BP    PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.579    FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB	 REOFFER    99.579</p>
<p> NOTES	*CALL AFTER THREE YEARS AND ALL INTEREST PAYMENTS</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
